{
  "name": "bill-benter",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 85.868,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Twenty-seven floors up, across the road from a Hong Kong racetrack, two men are watching a computer, not the race.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.856,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "56b87ccb6e97"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Bill Benter started out counting cards in Las Vegas, until the casinos blacklisted him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.266,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d9bcf4a48a99"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02b",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So he went looking for a game where the house couldn't throw him out: horse racing in Hong Kong.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.555,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c5a653251a85"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Hong Kong bet more on horses than the entire United States.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.224,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9bf9b7183874"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And it's a pool.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.731,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9bf9b7183874"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Bettors play against each other, while the club keeps about seventeen percent.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.474,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9bf9b7183874"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "To win, Benter had to beat the crowd by more than that.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.734,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9bf9b7183874"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He taught himself statistics.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.562,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1e94d5b9a71d"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Two typists spent nine months entering thousands of old races.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.438,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1e94d5b9a71d"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In nineteen eighty-five, he flew in with three computers in his luggage.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.306,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1e94d5b9a71d"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "The first season, he and his partner lost a hundred and twenty thousand dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.552,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1e94d5b9a71d"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The answer was hiding in plain sight: the crowd's own odds.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.59,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "64fbe0df1492"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His model stopped ignoring the public and started correcting it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.974,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "64fbe0df1492"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "One season, he says, that was worth about three million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.083,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "64fbe0df1492"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The club didn't ban him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.149,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "b44dc03f2820"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It called him one of its best customers, and let him plug his computers straight into its betting system.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.397,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "b44dc03f2820"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "His model grew to more than a hundred and twenty factors per horse.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.344,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "b44dc03f2820"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In nineteen ninety-seven, the club suspended his account.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.467,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2dc7433f43ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So his team printed betting slips and fed them into machines by hand, minutes before each race.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.072,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2dc7433f43ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Which brings us back to that night in two thousand one.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.053,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f66f3a75a84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Their computer had placed fifty-one thousand bets on one giant jackpot.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.182,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f66f3a75a84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "One of them hit: sixteen million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.472,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f66f3a75a84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Benter never cashed it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.009,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f66f3a75a84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "\"It would be unsporting,\" he said.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.656,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f66f3a75a84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "The tickets went into a safe, and the money went to charity.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.636,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f66f3a75a84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His operations made close to a billion dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.648,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f7a8782f69af"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t99",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So the next time you bet on a horse, who else is in that pool with you?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/bill-benter/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.438,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3febbc1b8c1a"
    }
  ]
}
